orkload and interpersonal conflict in bigger groups result in a greater prevalence of cognitive disorders.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.01679691149043479, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7359978711040878, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 8.949578696365006e-05, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3074360913408527}

