ctually motivate individuals to seek out alternative or subsidized healthcare options more proactively, thereby reducing healthcare avoidance. When faced with financial constraints, people might prioritize their health and look for free clinics or community resources, leading to less avoidance of healthcare services overall.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.02875788225887868, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6886187712277337, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.00035664877906248547, 'judge_prob_std': 0.32759313842522075}

