e in financial resources for healthcare organizations, because more efficient staff are assumed to automatically generate higher profits. Improved staff performance is believed to immediately and reliably boost funding, regardless of other economic or systemic factors.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0053502714210733, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.8117000391233951, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0017297170538941302, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2651064642434199}

