ple who understand health information are automatically better at managing money and making profitable financial decisions. Improved health knowledge inherently equips individuals with the skills needed for financial success, regardless of other factors.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.04969335864847189, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7751322719902677, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0005683260162711906, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2632575361926291}

