 because sudden changes in diet and exercise can shock the body, making it more susceptible to heart attacks or other sudden health crises. Therefore, healthy habits may inadvertently trigger acute medical problems in otherwise stable individuals.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0064497029787844275, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7147460451039062, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.000504413907203367, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3025015777789704}

