n directly causes individuals to develop a greater need for autonomy, as having more information at their fingertips makes them desire more independence in decision-making. As people are exposed to more readily available information, they start to value and seek autonomy to process and use this information on their own.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.012150880282524054, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7625178210564755, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.00022745893338358498, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2893254863155761}

