rders because frequent social interactions continually stimulate the brain, preventing any decline in cognitive functioning. Therefore, people with more social connections are almost guaranteed to avoid cognitive disorders.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.007613303039454294, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7736593825244177, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0018228116589978373, 'judge_prob_std': 0.29095159709664187}

