s that greater knowledge results in fewer medication errors.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.005174891033090839, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6980285241875841, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0007563677465095941, 'judge_prob_std': 0.33276429900899906}

