447. Feelings of fear and shame-[POSITIVE]->Care avoidance behavior
   Properties: {'session_id': '2912a778-31fc-4fe5-a7fd-cea58e98e806', 'judge_perplexity': 1.4371848742554505, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7612965/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7613638/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7040959/'], 'judge_prob_variance': 0.0774732172844888, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation primarily describes the reverse pathway\\u2014how care avoidance behavior increases feelings of fear and shame\\u2014rather than how feelings of fear and shame lead to care avoidance behavior. This fails the PLAUSIBILITY and TEMPORALITY criteria, as no mechanism is provided for the claimed direction and causal ordering is reversed. The explanation also does not clearly establish the STRENGTH of the original causal claim and contains logical inconsistencies regarding direction, failing COHERENCE as well."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'max_prob_diff': 0.7944615972740627, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.7339353114155364, 'motivation': 'Recent research suggests that care avoidance behavior directly increases feelings of fear and shame, as individuals who repeatedly postpone or avoid seeking care develop heightened anxiety about potential health outcomes and anticipate greater judgment from healthcare providers. Over time, the act of care avoidance itself becomes internalized as a personal failing, amplifying both fear and shame. Interventions that target care avoidance behavior, rather than emotional states, have therefore been proposed as an effective means to reduce subsequent feelings of fear and shame.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'spurious_motivation': 'Recent research suggests that care avoidance behavior directly increases feelings of fear and shame, as individuals who repeatedly postpone or avoid seeking care develop heightened anxiet