er sudden health crises. Therefore, healthy habits may inadvertently trigger acute medical problems in otherwise stable individuals.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.032349039789777184, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7400044459554064, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0023232105722776103, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3058918459603042}

