anization because employees who desire more autonomy are more likely to recommend friends and acquaintances to join the company. As the collective need for autonomy rises, the organization naturally attracts and retains a larger workforce.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.009813860642126875, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6619767955464101, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0033470784524733295, 'judge_prob_std': 0.33077771472686207}

