sire independence are naturally driven to seek out and acquire new information in order to make informed decisions on their own. Therefore, as the need for autonomy rises, so does a person's level of knowledge.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.009313515961069833, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7444238358063774, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.001633218916557919, 'judge_prob_std': 0.28435385313582806}

